e that Sal was unhappy about. Meanwhile, Pip receives an anonymous warning.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vTuMceHI6Uxi6hVCTxFwquDKMxv.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0ElMjBHb29kJTIwR2lybHMlMjBHdWlkZSUyMHRvJTIwTXVyZGVyJTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8.1.3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-07-17T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"When Pip follows new leads on the case, she takes bigger risks and enters the world of sex, drugs and rock 'n' roll.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sEBwyQKWVwbw3SlP8JnpIzVBkRe.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0ElMjBHb29kJTIwR2lybHMlMjBHdWlkZSUyMHRvJTIwTXVyZGVyJTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8.1.4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-07-17T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Pip and Ravi find out more about Andie's secret life, and when Pip is presented with a new piece of evidence, she reaches a crisis point and questions whether Sal is guilty.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zF4TRU2CgLRjchc2oWFgqp1NHYv.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0ElMjBHb29kJTIwR2lybHMlMjBHdWlkZSUyMHRvJTIwTXVyZGVyJTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8.1.5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-07-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Pip discovers more than she bargained for and faces dark consequences when she tries to confront the killer. Just when it seems all is lost, the terrible truth is revealed.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uBqP6OOmqp7fkDKpTVcvYsSq1KF.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0ElMjBHb29kJTIwR2lybHMlMjBHdWlkZSUyMHRvJTIwTXVyZGVyJTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8.1.6","title":"Episode 6","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-07-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Pip must come to terms with the repercussions of solving the case. But something isn't quite right, and Pip puts herself in danger once more to find out the whole truth.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/37aueb8rEyPyouLinzokTiaja6j.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0ElMjBHb29kJTIwR2lybHMlMjBHdWlkZSUyMHRvJTIwTXVyZGVyJTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8.2.1","title":"Episode 1","season":2,"episode":1,"released":"2026-05-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Pip attempts to return to normal life and focus on her friends, school and Ravi. But when a key witness in Max Hastings's trial disappears, Pip feels the pull of a new case.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3bGNxUF0fGvFfriWyotExHowFwF.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0ElMjBHb29kJTIwR2lybHMlMjBHdWlkZSUyMHRvJTIwTXVyZGVyJTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8.2.2","title":"Episode 2","season":2,"episode":2,"released":"2026-05-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Pip hits a dead end and rethinks. Digging into Jamie's recent behaviour and last movements, she realises he may not be an innocent victim after all.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oquu5JKUSjhcr8FUi2wv4Wof2d.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0ElMjBHb29kJTIwR2lybHMlMjBHdWlkZSUyMHRvJTIwTXVyZGVyJTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8.2.3","title":"Episode 3","season":2,"episode":3,"released":"2026-06-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Pip's day in court proves harder than she imagined, while a promising lead about Jamie comes from an unlikely source.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m8Xn558kKfig17XSkc8PTIM1gPA.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0ElMjBHb29kJTIwR2lybHMlMjBHdWlkZSUyMHRvJTIwTXVyZGVyJTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8.2.4","title":"Episode 4","season":2,"episode":4,"released":"2026-06-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Fresh evidence forces Pip back to her first line of inquiry with renewed urgency, while Max Hastings's testimony causes shock waves through the court.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7tLQ31QvBIWyIIs7OUGLcYQYuTR.j